# Ownership.
#
# Named individuals, not teams. A team name in CODEOWNERS means nobody is
# accountable, which is the same as no owner.
#
# Replace these handles with real accounts. An unfilled CODEOWNERS is worse than
# none, because it looks like coverage exists.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                       @lazarus/maintainers

# ── Security-critical surfaces ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# A change here is a security change. These require explicit review from someone
# other than the author (AGENTS.md §7).

# Policy is the chokepoint. A change here can widen what an operator can do.
apps/control-plane/src/Lazarus.Modules.Policy/    @lazarus/security-reviewers
docs/threat-model.md                                 @lazarus/security-reviewers
docs/adr/0010-policy-as-mandatory-chokepoint.md      @lazarus/security-reviewers
SECURITY.md                                          @lazarus/security-reviewers

# Runtime and Exec reach podman. Anything here runs a container.
apps/control-plane/src/Lazarus.Modules.Runtime/    @lazarus/security-reviewers
apps/control-plane/src/Lazarus.Modules.Exec/       @lazarus/security-reviewers
infra/                                               @lazarus/security-reviewers

# Auth is the trust root.
services/auth/                                       @lazarus/security-reviewers

# ── Contracts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The schema is a security boundary as well as a contract (ADR-0007, ADR-0010).
packages/spec/                                       @lazarus/maintainers @lazarus/security-reviewers
packages/contracts/                                  @lazarus/maintainers
tools/codegen/                                      @lazarus/maintainers

# ── Tenancy ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
apps/control-plane/src/Lazarus.Modules.Tenancy/     @lazarus/security-reviewers
apps/control-plane/src/Lazarus.Infrastructure/      @lazarus/maintainers @lazarus/security-reviewers

# ── Working rules ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AGENTS.md                                            @lazarus/maintainers
TODO.md                                              @lazarus/maintainers
docs/adr/                                            @lazarus/maintainers

# ── Generated and vendored ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated code is regenerated by CI, not reviewed. Requests to edit it directly
# are declined (AGENTS.md §4.7).
packages/contracts/          @lazarus/maintainers
**/node_modules/             @lazarus/maintainers